1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,020
In February 1995,

2
00:00:01,020 --> 00:00:04,260
a twenty-eight-year-old trader in Singapore bankrupted

3
00:00:04,260 --> 00:00:05,040
Barings Bank,

4
00:00:05,040 --> 00:00:07,860
Britain's oldest merchant bank founded in 1762,

5
00:00:07,860 --> 00:00:10,200
using one hidden error account numbered

6
00:00:10,200 --> 00:00:10,920
five eights.

7
00:00:10,920 --> 00:00:13,172
London executives let Nick Leeson run

8
00:00:13,172 --> 00:00:15,484
both the trading floor and back-office

9
00:00:15,484 --> 00:00:16,154
settlement,

10
00:00:16,154 --> 00:00:18,771
allowing him to conceal unauthorized Nikkei

11
00:00:18,771 --> 00:00:21,266
futures losses inside account 88888 until

12
00:00:21,266 --> 00:00:23,640
the January 1995 Kobe earthquake pushed

13
00:00:23,640 --> 00:00:26,317
losses to eight hundred twenty-seven million

14
00:00:26,317 --> 00:00:26,743
pounds,

15
00:00:26,743 --> 00:00:28,630
and Barings sold for one pound.

16
00:00:28,630 --> 00:00:31,272
Solo investors and founders recreate that

17
00:00:31,272 --> 00:00:33,786
fatal structural flaw whenever the same

18
00:00:33,786 --> 00:00:35,848
excited brain placing a bet also

19
00:00:35,848 --> 00:00:37,202
grades the scorecard,

20
00:00:37,202 --> 00:00:39,973
moving goalposts and averaging down instead

21
00:00:39,973 --> 00:00:41,520
of booking a small loss.

22
00:00:41,520 --> 00:00:43,771
Separate execution from accounting:

23
00:00:43,771 --> 00:00:45,507
lock in hard position caps,

24
00:00:45,507 --> 00:00:46,858
automated stop rules,

25
00:00:46,858 --> 00:00:49,687
and read-only spending limits before capital

26
00:00:49,687 --> 00:00:50,330
goes live,

27
00:00:50,330 --> 00:00:52,452
then review every number during a

28
00:00:52,452 --> 00:00:53,610
cold Friday audit.

29
00:00:53,610 --> 00:00:55,740
Never let your inner promoter audit

30
00:00:55,740 --> 00:00:56,653
its own trades,

31
00:00:56,653 --> 00:00:59,269
because two centuries of compounding vanish

32
00:00:59,269 --> 00:01:01,460
fast without independent guardrails.
